  <h2 id="sales">Who pays for these skills, and how they judge you</h2>

  <p>
    Banks, insurers and their customers pay for trust and accuracy. They judge you by honesty, care with numbers and clear explanation.
  </p>
  <p>
    The first basic skill is explaining one money concept in plain words.
  </p>

  <h2 id="ai">AI and banking and insurance interview answers: which tasks are under pressure</h2>

  <p>
    AI tools suggest careers from interests and summarise roles. Treat the output as a list to test, not an answer.
  </p>
  <p>
    Self-knowledge, real trials and decisions you own hold value. A staged path helps: now, use AI to generate options; later, test them with people and small projects.
  </p>

  <h2 id="better">Alternatives that can beat a general banking and insurance interview answers path</h2>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table paths-table--wide">
